# Local helm dependency artifacts - regenerate on demand with:
#   helm dependency build charts/<subchart>
#   helm dependency build krypton-umbrella-slim/charts/<subchart>
# They stay out of git so a stale vendored copy of the library chart can never
# shadow the live one under charts/ at render time. The umbrella-level
# Chart.lock files are ignored too: the dependencies are repository-less
# directories, so a lock adds nothing and a stale one makes ArgoCD's
# `helm dependency build` fail with "Chart.lock is out of sync".
charts/*/charts/
charts/*/Chart.lock
krypton-umbrella-slim/charts/*/charts/
krypton-umbrella-slim/charts/*/Chart.lock
Chart.lock
krypton-umbrella-slim/Chart.lock
*.tgz
